[manifest]
desc="Loki is a horizontally-scalable, highly-available, multi-tenant log aggregation system inspired by Prometheus. <br>It is designed to be very cost effective and easy to operate. <br>It does not index the contents of the logs, but rather a set of labels for each log stream.<br>For details, refer to the official documentation <a href="https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/get-started/overview/">https://grafana.com/docs/loki/latest/get-started/overview/</a><br>When using it, make sure to configure firewall rules correctly or add authentication checks to avoid losses caused by unauthorized access<br>Persistent configuration is stored in the storage space selected during installation<br>/volX/@appshare/grafana.loki"
